OL,4,CBBC loses court battle over Stig
OL,5, The BBC has lost a legal fight to stop
OL,6, publication of a book which reveals the
OL,7, identity of Top Gear's driver The Stig.
OL,9,FThe High Court in London refused to
OL,10,Fgrant the BBC an injunction blocking
OL,11,Fthe publication by HarperCollins of an
OL,12,Fautobiography of former Formula Three
OL,13,Fdriver Ben Collins.
OL,15,FThe book, called The Man In The White
OL,16,FSuit, claims Mr Collins is the mystery
OL,17,Fdriver on the BBC Two show.
OL,19,FThe BBC began legal action against
OL,20,FHarperCollins last week.
OL,22,D]C This Ceefax page is from 01-09-10
OL,23,S]D Much more at: teletextarchive.com
