OL,4,CMoD criticised over blast death
OL,5, An expert died following top-secret
OL,6, explosives tests which were not
OL,7, properly planned and organised, an
OL,8, inquest jury has ruled.
OL,10,FMinistry of Defence scientist Terry
OL,11,FJupp died six days after the accident
OL,12,Fin August 2002 at the Foulness Island
OL,13,Fsite in Essex.
OL,15,FThe 46-year-old suffered between 60 and
OL,16,F90% burns when 10kg of an undisclosed
OL,17,Fmixture of chemicals suddenly ignited.
OL,19,FIt happened during a joint US-UK
OL,20,Fcounter-terrorism project.
OL,22,D]C This Ceefax page is from 01-09-10
OL,23,S]D Much more at: teletextarchive.com
