OL,4,CBBC staff vote for pension strike
OL,5, BBC staff members have voted in favour
OL,6, of strike action in a dispute over
OL,7, pensions.
OL,9,FBectu and the National Union of
OL,10,FJournalists said more than 90% of
OL,11,Fmembers had voted for a walk out.
OL,13,FBut the unions said the decision on
OL,14,Fwhether to strike would be postponed
OL,15,Ffor two weeks while it discussed
OL,16,Falternative proposals with the BBC.
OL,18,FIn June, the BBC announced plans to
OL,19,Foverhaul its pension scheme to try and
OL,20,Ftackle a #2bn deficit.
OL,22,D]C This Ceefax page is from 01-09-10
OL,23,S]D Much more at: teletextarchive.com
